meta {
  name: 03 Admin access control
  seq: 4
}

docs {
  How the central gate in `bootstrap.php` behaves: CSRF is checked *before* auth,
  so an unauthenticated write is 419 (not 401); a GET to any `/api/admin/*` path
  is 401 (anon) or 403 (non-admin) before routing, so a bogus admin path only
  404s for a real admin.

  Requires "00 Setup".
}
